@startuml
title PayLink - Refund a Failed Payment

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber "<b>0"

actor Customer
participant "Payment\nProcessing" as PP
participant "Accounts\nand Wallet" as WL
participant "Biller\nIntegration" as BI
participant "Biller\n(e.g. AquaCo)" as BL
participant "Reconciliation" as RC
participant "Notifications" as NT
participant "Audit Log" as AL
' [Q2] new participant for ignored callbacks and events
participant "Callback /\nEvent Log" as EL

== 1. Trigger: the payment becomes Failed ==
alt A. Biller refuses (live biller, e.g. AquaCo)
    note right of PP : State: SentToBiller
    BL --> BI : Refused (error code)
    BI --> PP : Refused\n(PayLink reason, not the raw code)
else B. TopUpNet callback "failed"
    note right of PP : State: SentToBiller
    BL -> BI : Callback "failed" (payment reference)
    BI -> PP : Callback result: failed
else C. Re-query of an Unknown payment says refused
    note right of PP : State: Unknown\nMoney stays held
    PP -> BI : Status query (after 1, 5 or 15 minutes)
    BI -> BL : Status request
    BL --> BI : Refused
    BI --> PP : Refused
else D. Reconciliation finds no payment
    note right of PP : State: Unknown\nMoney stays held
    BL -> RC : Settlement file (payment not listed)
    RC -> PP : Unknown payment not in file
end

' [Q3] NetCo next-morning result file is not drawn as a branch (NetCo is optional)
note over PP, BL
    Unknown is never refunded automatically.
    After 3 unanswered re-queries it stays Unknown
    and waits for reconciliation (no refund).
    NetCo failures (next-morning result file) are not
    drawn here because NetCo is optional.
end note

PP -> PP : fail(reason)
note right of PP : State: Failed

== 2. Release the hold and refund ==
PP -> WL : Release hold (immediately)
' [Q4] a hold that is not ACTIVE is a safe ignore, not an error
WL -> WL : Hold is ACTIVE?\nYes: create release ledger entry\nfor the full total (amount + fee)\nNo: safe ignore, no entry
WL --> PP : Funds returned\n(available up, held 0.00)
PP -> PP : refund()
note right of PP : State: Refunded (final)
note over WL
    No final charge, no fee income
    and no agent commission are created.
end note

== 3. Audit record ==
WL -> AL : Record release\n(who = system, when, why)

== 4. Notification ==
PP -> NT : Payment result event (Failed)
NT --> Customer : SMS and push with a clear reason\n(says the money is returned)
note over NT
    No separate message on Refunded.
    A provider failure never rolls back the refund.
end note

' [Q1] one single ignore path for any late or duplicate event
== 5. Duplicate or late events ==
opt Late or duplicate failure event or callback arrives
    BL -> BI : Duplicate "failed", callback or any late result
    BI -> PP : Result for the payment
    PP -> PP : Payment already Refunded or in another\nfinal / non-eligible state?\nYes: ignore (state unchanged)
    note over WL : No second release entry,\nbalances unchanged
    ' [Q2] ignored events go to the callback / event log, not the audit log
    PP -> EL : Log ignored callback or event
end
@enduml